# Loot has haste, vigilance and double strike (CR 702.10, 702.20, 702.4): cast on turn 1 it attacks at once for 2 + 2 = 4 and, with
# vigilance, is still untapped afterwards - so its {T} exhaust ability can be paid in the second main phase: Black Lotus gives
# {U}{U}{U}, one pays "{U}, {T}: Draw three cards", and Loot is tapped then.

